<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Triumph for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 3</h3>You want to fill holes in your gear with Emblem items, and also to get the best in slot <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47666/totem-of-electrifying-wind">
