<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 3</h3>
<span class="socket-meta q0"></span>
<b>Meta sockets</b> are unique to head slot pieces and accept meta gems (instead of regular gems). Only a single meta socket may exist in any given piece, and many pieces come without a meta socket at all.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41398/relentless-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relentless Earthsiege Diamond</span></a> is the best meta gem, and scales well with the rest of your gear, as it acts as a multiplier on your damage output. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48353/nobundos-faceguard-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_95.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nobundo's Faceguard of Triumph</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48358/thralls-faceguard-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Thrall's Faceguard of Triumph</span></a> are the best helms available, and also contribute towards your Tier 9 bonuses. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45610/boundless-gaze">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boundless Gaze</span></a> is also strong, and a decent non-set alternative.<br/>
<br/>The Tier 8 helms, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46212/conquerors-worldbreaker-faceguard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_69.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Worldbreaker Faceguard</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45412/valorous-worldbreaker-faceguard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_69.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Worldbreaker Faceguard</span></a> are still decent, and have strong standalone stats, while also being much easier to obtain now in Phase 3.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44879/arcanum-of-torment">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_rampage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Torment</span></a>
