<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47112/belt-of-the-merciless-killer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_37c.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Merciless Killer</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47460/belt-of-the-pitiless-killer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_38b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Pitiless Killer</span></a> are the best belts available in Phase 3 due to their high stats, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47084/cord-of-biting-cold">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of Biting Cold</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47447/belt-of-biting-cold">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Biting Cold</span></a> are even better as they perform similarly on single target while being vastly superior on cleave, but as those can be hard to obtain, consider using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45553/belt-of-dragons">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Dragons</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45827/belt-of-the-ardent-marksman">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Ardent Marksman</span></a>, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45491/waistguard-of-the-creator">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Waistguard of the Creator</span></a> as easier to get alternatives.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Belt Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41611/eternal-belt-buckle">
