<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons, Shields, Off-hands and Totems for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 3</h2>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="1-handed-weapons-for-enhancement-shaman-dps-in-phase-3">1-Handed Weapons for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 3</h4>Due to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=16284/flurry">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_ghoulfrenzy.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flurry</span></a> having a 0.5 seconds cooldown on being consumed, <b>having weapons of matching speed</b> can be useful to minimize attack desynching and maximize your Flurry uptime. Some of the main-hand (MH) and off-hand (OH) weapons we list below have similar speeds and weapons with the same speed are meant to be used <b>together</b>, whenever possible.<br/>
<br/>Also, as much of an Enhancement <a class="icontiny c7" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/shaman">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_shaman.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shaman</span></a>'s damage comes from spells that scale with Spell Power rather than Weapon DPS /<wbr/> Attack Power (other than <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=30814/mental-quickness">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_mentalquickness.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mental Quickness</span></a>), picking up a caster weapon is recommended for trash or bosses with multiple adds, and it performs decently in single target as well.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-enhancement-shaman-dps-in-phase-3">Weapons for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 3</h4>With the release of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a>, <b>Spell Power</b> weapons become the definitive best in slot main-hand items, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47483/sufferings-end">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_103.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Suffering's End</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47206/miserys-end">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_107.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Misery's End</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46980/blade-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blade of Tarasque</span></a>, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47422/barb-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Barb of Tarasque</span></a> being the best main-hands. Use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47156/stormpike-cleaver">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_105.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormpike Cleaver</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47475/hellscream-slicer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_104.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hellscream Slicer</span></a> in the off-hand for the ideal setup.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45132/golden-saronite-dragon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_hand_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Saronite Dragon</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45620/starshard-edge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starshard Edge</span></a> (<b>heavily contested</b>) are still great main-hand weapons, with Golden Saronite Dragon being a physical-focused main hand option and Starshard Edge being a strong Spell Power option. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45612/constellus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Constellus</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46035/aesuga-hand-of-the-ardent-champion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Aesuga, Hand of the Ardent Champion</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45449/the-masticator">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_hand_22.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Masticator</span></a> are also great main-hand weapons and much less contested than the top choices.<br/>
<br/>Finally, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=39763/wraith-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_hand_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wraith Strike</span></a> <b>is still quite good</b> as the only Spell Power weapon with slow speed in the list, although it sports relatively low stats compared to Phase 3 gear. Pair it with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45463/vulmir-the-northern-tempest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_91.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vulmir, the Northern Tempest</span></a> for a budget, yet powerful, setup.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59621/enchant-weapon-berserking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Berserking</span></a>
